.jpg/500px-2009_3962573662_card_catalog.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/2009_3962573662_card_catalog.jpg/1280px-2009_3962573662_card_catalog.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/2009_3962573662_card_catalog.jpg/500px-2009_3962573662_card_catalog.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Until the advent of digital catalogues, card catalogues were the traditional method of organizing the list of resources and their location within a large library.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A2009_3962573662_card_catalog.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Howard_Tilton_Library_Computers_2010.jpg/500px-Howard_Tilton_Library_Computers_2010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Howard_Tilton_Library_Computers_2010.jpg/1280px-Howard_Tilton_Library_Computers_2010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Howard_Tilton_Library_Computers_2010.jpg/500px-Howard_Tilton_Library_Computers_2010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Library patrons using the Internet at Howard Tilton Library at Tulane University in New Orleans, Louisiana","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHoward_Tilton_Library_Computers_2010.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Fukuchiyama_Public_Library_2F_ac_%285%29.jpg/500px-Fukuchiyama_Public_Library_2F_ac_%285%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Fukuchiyama_Public_Library_2F_ac_%285%29.jpg/1280